*color8:       base03
*color9:       base12
*color10:      base14
*color11:      base13
*color12:      base16
*color13:      base17
*color14:      base15
*color15:      base07

! Note: colors beyond 15 might not be loaded (e.g., xterm, urxvt),
! use 'shell' template to set these if necessary
*color16:      base09
*color17:      base0F
*color18:      base01
*color19:      base02
*color20:      base04
